[Mark] ... REAL good.

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:51.040
[Mark] Staining is really the main fear...

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.340
[Sound byte] "Where am I??"

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.540
[Amy] Ethan's got three bottles that he didn't put back.
[Mark gasping]
[Wilhelm scream]

00:09:01.380 --> 00:09:02.020
[thunk]
[Mark] Wha-?!

00:09:02.020 --> 00:09:04.440
[Mark] I feel like there were a lot more bottles here before.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:12.920
[organ/choir music]

00:09:13.060 --> 00:09:14.840
[Ethan] Oh no. Oh no!
[Tyler] Red.
[Mark] I already GOT red.

00:09:14.840 --> 00:09:16.600
[Ethan] Have my fingers leaked through?! 
[Amy laughing]

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:18.220
[Ethan] Are my fingers through?!

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:19.400
[Mark] Huh??
[Ethan] Do I need new gloves?!

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:21.320
[Mark] No one's gonna tell you! How much time do we got?

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.220
[Amy] A minute twenty-five.

00:09:23.980 --> 00:09:24.480
[Ethan gasping in fear]

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:31.660
[Mark] Okay, all right, that's all just a little. Just a, like a sweet dab.

00:09:31.980 --> 00:09:34.080
[Mark] Sorry, I just touched you with my shirt.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:35.040
[Ethan] Oh...

00:09:35.040 --> 00:09:36.420
[Tyler] I need--
[Amy] You've got 30 seconds.
[Mark] Okay.

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:38.720
[Ethan] 30 seconds. I think mine's done. I don't know.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:40.720
[Ethan] I did the water. I did the- I did some sploosh on it...

00:09:40.820 --> 00:09:42.840
[Mark] I-I think I did everything I wanted to do.

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:46.180
[Ethan] What are you envisioning? Before we all bring up our blindfolds?

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:47.760
[Ethan] What are we envisioning that we have?

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:50.840
[Tyler] I think mine is a spider with multicolored legs.

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.260
[Ethan] Well, let's talk about colors first.

00:09:52.260 --> 00:09:53.700
[Amy] Time's up!
[Ethan] Because I feel like...

00:09:53.700 --> 00:09:57.800
[Ethan] ... other than the shape we could try and figure out the colors based on where we reached.

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.800
[Mark] Alright no one look yet.
[Ethan] I think I had some yellow??
[Tyler] Okay.

00:09:59.800 --> 00:10:01.480
[Ethan] And a little bit of blue and a little bit of red.
[Tyler] I think I got...

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:06.760
[Tyler] ... red and blue and a purple. And I think I grabbed black at the end? But I hope not.

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:09.360
[Mark] I was trying to go for every color of the rainbow. I think.

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:11.360
[Mark] I thi-- [laughing]

00:10:11.660 --> 00:10:12.180
[Mark] Shush!

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.440
[Mark] I was close! I don't think I--

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:15.080
[Mark] Oh I got a splash of green in there!
[Ethan laughs]

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:15.580
[Tyler] You got a nice yellow.

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:17.580
[Mark] I got a little green in there but not... not as much as I wanted.

00:10:17.580 --> 00:10:18.760
[Ethan] I got kind of a cool tie-dye shirt!

00:10:18.820 --> 00:10:22.460
[Ethan] Did you get the classic spiral?
[Mark] I don't know. I tried? Lemme see.

00:10:22.860 --> 00:10:25.800
[Ooo's and aaah's]

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:27.800
[Ethan] That's kinda cool!
[Mark] That's not bad!

00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:33.420
[Mark] It's not as colored as I would have liked it, but you know... Kind of like, it's got a minimalist feel to it.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.360
[Tyler] Mine's a very white shirt with a lot of different...

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.280
[Mark] I like it 'cause you've got, like, stuff on the sleeves.

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:42.220
[Ethan] Yeah, I think me doing a lot of water maybe the spread happen.

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:44.760
[Mark] Yeah, but the spread's cool! You got a fully colored shirt.

00:10:44.760 --> 00:10:47.480
[Mark] We'll come-- We'll be right back, when they're dry.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:50.960
[Mark] In the meantime, here's a- a- a word from our sponsor.

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:52.320
[Ethan] I SAID GET READY TO COME (CUM?).

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.260
[Mark] Scene change!

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:56.740
[Mark] We're in a different place, but we got our shirts and our shirts are dry. Check them out.

00:10:56.740 --> 00:10:57.440
[Mark] This is a shirt.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:00.080
[Mark] That's a shirt. This is a shirt. So--

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:01.220
[Amy] Why aren't you spinning?

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.480
[Mark] Am I supposed to spin?

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:04.520
[Ethan] Yeah, you have to... rotisserize. 
[Tyler] Show off your shirt.

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:06.100
[Mark] Why do I have to spin??

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.180
[Ethan] Well, to show the whole shirt!
[Tyler] Show the whole shirt, man.

00:11:09.540 --> 00:11:10.180
[Ethan] Yeah!
[Tyler] Yeah.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:13.980
[Tyler] That's good.
[Mark] Thank you.

00:11:16.340 --> 00:11:18.040
[Ethan] Oh, yeah, it's- it's good.

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:19.480
[laughter]

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.660
[Mark] Alright, so let's judge them. Um...

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:27.300
[Mark] That one... it's not bad but it lost integrity of the shape it was in?

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:31.680
[Mark] Like, uh, I can't tell, like, if it was a spiral, if it was a circle out...

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:34.869
[Mark] That's the only thing I'll say about it. Plus the rubbings. Let me see the back.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.580
[Mark] Yeah, that-- You got like a lot of rubbings back here.

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.720
[Ethan] It doesn't entirely look intentional.

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.800
[Tyler] I personally think Mark's is the best.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.800
[Mark] You think that?
[Tyler] Yeah.
[Mark] You really think it?

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:46.520
[Mark] Yours sucks.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.740
[Ethan, laughing] Yeah it just kinda looks like a kid threw up.

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:49.900
[Ethan, laughing] Yeah it just kinda looks like a kid threw up.
[Mark] No actually--

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:54.680
[Mark] I-I could see that like that being a mass-produced... like, just, design.

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:56.840
[Ethan] Th-There's too much green. It's bad.

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:59.000
[Evan speaks unintelligibly]
[Tyler] It's very green.
[Ethan] Yeah.

00:11:59.000 --> 00:12:02.100
[Ethan] That's what happened when I dunked it in. It just all soaked up the color.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.640
[Mark] Yeah, just too much water. 
[Ethan] Mm-hmm

00:12:03.640 --> 00:12:06.360
[Mark] Yeah, but not bad! Like, for my first tie-dye.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:11.320
[Mark] I bet I wouldn't have been able to do something that looked good if I tried, and could see.

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.400
[Mark] 'Cause I literally just... it just happens to turn out this way, but it worked!

00:12:13.400 --> 00:12:14.000
[Ethan] Yeah!
[Mark] 'Cause I literally just... it just happens to turn out this way, but it worked!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.200
[Mark] 'Cause I literally just... it just happens to turn out this way, but it worked!

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:18.620
[Mark] I think the chaos is what made it really special.

00:12:20.740 --> 00:12:22.360
[Mark] ... Okay.
[laughter]

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.360
[Ethan] I like the sleeve! I like that color a lot.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:25.360
[Mark] Yeah no, that's good.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:26.800
[Tyler] I like the...
[Mark] Yeah, your sleeves are on point.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:32.319
[Mark] If you could, like, cut those sleeves off, put it on to just a plain white t-shirt, that actually might look really cool.

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:36.680
[Mark] It wouldn't be worth it. By any stretch of the imagination. But it'd look cool.

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:37.860
[Mark] Why'd you rub it, man?

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.700
[Tyler] 'Cause I... It was the way I thought to get more ink.

00:12:40.760 --> 00:12:41.640
[Mark] ... Why'd you rub it.

00:12:41.640 --> 00:12:43.380
[Ethan] Don't rub it.
[Mark] Don't rub it.

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:44.800
[Ethan] If you're at home... don't rub it.
[Mark] Don't rub it.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:45.720
[Mark] Hey. Stop rubbing.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:46.620
[Amy laughs]

00:12:46.900 --> 00:12:47.640
[Mark] Cut it out.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:49.640
[Mark] Get some help.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.300
Anyway, thank you so much for watching!

